<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 16.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/94    100/101    UNQ    166/168</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  95/97    101/102  175/180  185/190</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes moved slightly down on Monday with few enquiries, traders said. As demand was poor, majors reduced their offers by $1/$2 per tonne to join the fierce competition.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
